Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":24,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2347,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1827510,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":268526,"Name":"Boston LinKat","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268526.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1390237106,"LastPoster":{"Id":285438,"Name":"jonesharry","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.gif?_r=1450860155","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1827510,"PostDate":1390237106,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies, \u00a0 How are people addressing their envelopes for invitations - handwriting, printing or...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katstepasiuk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.6.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365866117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268526.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Boston LinKat","Id":268526,"Name":"Boston LinKat","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.37.244.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dd510d5ad3bfb27950bf6d92bc9d5b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How are people addressing their envelopes for invitations - handwriting, printing or professional calligraphy?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nI need to get mine out STAT - there are about 64 of them. &amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t want to pay for calligraphy and my handwriting gets pretty bad after a few. &amp;nbsp;Is printing on your envelopes tacky? &amp;nbsp;If anyone has printed, can you recommend a good, free program to use? &amp;nbsp;Any other tips?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827510,"PostDate":1390237106,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How are people addressing their envelopes for invitations - handwriting, printing or professional calligraphy?<\/p>\n<p>\nI need to get mine out STAT - there are about 64 of them. \u00a0I don't want to pay for calligraphy and my handwriting gets pretty bad after a few. \u00a0Is printing on your envelopes tacky? \u00a0If anyone has printed, can you recommend a good, free program to use? \u00a0Any other tips?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katstepasiuk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.6.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365866117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268526.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Boston LinKat","Id":268526,"Name":"Boston LinKat","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.231.102.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea80dee935916571353d88ee51d5159b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey, I totally hear you on the handwriting and how it get pretty bad after a while! We are just printing them on a clear labels and using the font that is on word.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827550,"PostDate":1390244659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey, I totally hear you on the handwriting and how it get pretty bad after a while! We are just printing them on a clear labels and using the font that is on word.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382039086,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca21ecbbd6b0e22d3361a330f57feabf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did the same as @[member=\"krisdaversa\"]... I purchased clear labels and wrote our guest names and addresses on the label. I also added a little palm tree to the label to make it look cute. I didn&#039;t realize that proper etiquette dictates you should hand write it. Honestly I&amp;nbsp;would have never known that and I&amp;nbsp;really wouldn&#039;t think twice about it if someone&amp;nbsp;sent me a handwritten letter or a computer typed one, so I like to think neither would other people!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827554,"PostDate":1390245286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did the same as @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274333\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274333-krisdaversa\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">krisdaversa<\/span><\/a>... I purchased clear labels and wrote our guest names and addresses on the label. I also added a little palm tree to the label to make it look cute. I didn't realize that proper etiquette dictates you should hand write it. Honestly I\u00a0would have never known that and I\u00a0really wouldn't think twice about it if someone\u00a0sent me a handwritten letter or a computer typed one, so I like to think neither would other people!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351780968,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.224.242.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42e1de4a8a749acf91911d13dfded612","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For my save the dates I purchased those calligraphy pens from Staples for like maybe $10 and it came with 6 colors (but I&#039;m sure you can find them other places) and I was really surprised how it made my handwriting look so much better. Now for my invitations I decided it was to time consuming addressing around 120 invitations so I bought the clear address labels and plan on using those to save me time. Good Luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827622,"PostDate":1390267864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For my save the dates I purchased those calligraphy pens from Staples for like maybe $10 and it came with 6 colors (but I'm sure you can find them other places) and I was really surprised how it made my handwriting look so much better. Now for my invitations I decided it was to time consuming addressing around 120 invitations so I bought the clear address labels and plan on using those to save me time. Good Luck!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ajlloyd15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.224.242.8","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1375205415,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272066.jpg?_r=1389283937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ajlloyd15","Id":272066,"Name":"ajlloyd15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.194.5.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by NJBride2014, 20 January 2014 - 08:04 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1390277048,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d12ac735253bf1089c9e9b2b196f8fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did faux calligraphy which basically is to print the addresses on the envelopes with very light ink and then trace them in whatever color you want. &amp;nbsp;Works great and saves you lots of money. &amp;nbsp; Here is a tutorial&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.projectwedding.com\/forums\/diy-faux-calligraphy-tutorial&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.projectwedding.com\/forums\/diy-faux-calligraphy-tutorial&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/cdnpix.com\/show\/imgs\/704fd0ea134c47c1fbef7a66b2d9648b.jpg\" alt=\"704fd0ea134c47c1fbef7a66b2d9648b.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827654,"PostDate":1390276960,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did faux calligraphy which basically is to print the addresses on the envelopes with very light ink and then trace them in whatever color you want. \u00a0Works great and saves you lots of money. \u00a0 Here is a tutorial\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.projectwedding.com\/forums\/diy-faux-calligraphy-tutorial' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.projectwe...graphy-tutorial<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdnpix.com\/show\/imgs\/704fd0ea134c47c1fbef7a66b2d9648b.jpg\" alt=\"704fd0ea134c47c1fbef7a66b2d9648b.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357674861,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.138.102.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5783bc319c16e55b74e45dcc8dbc48f6","RawContent":"I&#039;ve never heard of faux calligraphy. That&#039;s great. I did calligraphy pens for my stds maybe I&#039;ll try that for the invites. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/tapatalk.com\/m?id=1\"&gt;Tapatalk&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828447,"PostDate":1390511443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've never heard of faux calligraphy. That's great. I did calligraphy pens for my stds maybe I'll try that for the invites. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using <a href='http:\/\/tapatalk.com\/m?id=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Tapatalk<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383905354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.175.121.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8bade0733ce849ab38e137a27bbd8d6","RawContent":"I used Avery labels and downloaded the template.","Attachments":[],"Id":1830413,"PostDate":1391169771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I used Avery labels and downloaded the template.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tesayoung@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.7.26.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386792595,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/pro