&gt;\n \n And Laura Ryan. She does boudoir photography, there are just no galleries of it on the site. But if you email her, she will send you her galleries of boudoir photography and her prices. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.lauraryanphotography.com\/\"&gt;Laura Ryan Photography, Wedding Photography - Serving the Tri - State Area&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Tony Yang &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/intime.knsaber.com\/\"&gt;intime by tony yang&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Irinia &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.creativeiphotography.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.creativeiphotography.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":457975,"PostDate":1222063782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                There are a few people I know of who do boudoir photography in NY.<br \/> <br \/> I will be using mariann from blue daisy boudoir. <a href='http:\/\/www.bluedaisyboudoir.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Blue Daisy Boudoir | Boudoir portraits for New York City brides and women<\/a><br \/> <br \/> There is also angelica glass. <a href='http:\/\/www.angelicaglass.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Angelica Glass Photography<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Then there is fedali. <a href='http:\/\/www.fedali.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Fedali<\/a><br \/> <br \/> And Laura Ryan. She does boudoir photography, there are just no galleries of it on the site. But if you email her, she will send you her galleries of boudoir photography and her prices. <a href='http:\/\/www.lauraryanphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Laura Ryan Photography, Wedding Photography - Serving the Tri - State Area<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Tony Yang <a href='http:\/\/intime.knsaber.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>intime by tony yang<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Irinia <a href='http:\/\/www.creativeiphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.creativeiphotography.com\/<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"goldenstar1389@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219449344,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211337.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beach vows","Id":211337,"Name":"beach vows","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"182a69b7ec71023087b7d39ed33eeac1","RawContent":"thanks beachvows, i saw mariann&#039;s site from blue daisy. but she was the only one i could find. how are her prices? and what made you choose her over the others?","Attachments":[],"Id":458000,"PostDate":1222064978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks beachvows, i saw mariann's site from blue daisy. but she was the only one i could find. how are her prices? and what made you choose her over the others?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mimirdh1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221292113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211702.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rdhbride","Id":211702,"Name":"rdhbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"732b76242df25a0d5c2f54fe5b61c318","RawContent":"I am also interested, I was planning on looking into Miriam as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":458129,"PostDate":1222097757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also interested, I was planning on looking into Miriam as well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyblant@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220225940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211491.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyblant","Id":211491,"Name":"amyblant","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0bb3ebeb35badec9a111afbca342589","RawContent":"Mariann&#039;s Prices:\n This is just an overview.\n \n $500 - 1.5 hour session. High res disk. 5 retouched.\n $750 - 2.5 hour session. High res disk. 10 retouched.\n $1000 - 3.5 hour session. High res disk. 15 retouched.\n \n But contact her for more pricing details. I chose her because of her style and her personality. I just clicked from her from the start, she makes you feel really comfortable, which is so important in this type of photography. \n \n Angelica Glass is amazing also but more expensive.\n \n Fedali - Similar pricing to blue daisy but i dont think they&#039;re as artistic.\n \n Laura Ryan - She was my second choice. But she doesnt have as much experience with boudoir as mariann does.\n \n Tony Yang - LOVE his style...just wouldnt be comfortable doing this type of photography in front of a male.","Attachments":[],"Id":458192,"PostDate":1222105780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mariann's Prices:<br \/> This is just an overview.<br \/> <br \/> $500 - 1.5 hour session. High res disk. 5 retouched.<br \/> $750 - 2.5 hour session. High res disk. 10 retouched.<br \/> $1000 - 3.5 hour session. High res disk. 15 retouched.<br \/> <br \/> But contact her for more pricing details. I chose her because of her style and her personality. I just clicked from her from the start, she makes you feel really comfortable, which is so important in this type of photography. <br \/> <br \/> Angelica Glass is amazing also but more expensive.<br \/> <br \/> Fedali - Similar pricing to blue daisy but i dont think they're as artistic.<br \/> <br \/> Laura Ryan - She was my second choice. But she doesnt have as much experience with boudoir as mariann does.<br \/> <br \/> Tony Yang - LOVE his style...just wouldnt be comfortable doing this type of photography in front of a male.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"goldenstar1389@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219449344,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211337.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beach vows","Id":211337,"Name":"beach vows","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f78e52682515204ec60e51d4f0c1366","RawContent":"and Irinia...still may look into her. Prices seem great. Need to go to the studio to see the set up and more of her gallery bc there arent that many photos on the site.","Attachments":[],"Id":458193,"PostDate":1222105844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\