n the fridge.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This will be our STD invites so our family and close friends will see our face everyday hahaha and remind them of our DW in 2017&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I paid &amp;nbsp;$10 for 20 calendar with vista print 50% promotion. (I totally forgot our names on it lol)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":34215,"Name":"preview.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-283943-0-47749600-1445546401.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-283943-0-47749600-1445546401_thumb.jpg","Width":402,"Height":312}],"Id":1906727,"PostDate":1445547344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I ordered this magnetic 2016 calendar from vista print. I love those magnetic calendars on the fridge.<\/p>\n<p>This will be our STD invites so our family and close friends will see our face everyday hahaha and remind them of our DW in 2017<\/p>\n<p>I paid \u00a0$10 for 20 calendar with vista print 50% promotion. (I totally forgot our names on it lol)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1906727]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-283943-0-00381400-1445546612.jpg\" title=\"preview.jpg - Size: 58.35KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-283943-0-00381400-1445546612.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"preview.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"j.isip@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.185.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436821171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283943.jpg?_r=1442701525","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jacquewedding","Id":283943,"Name":"jacquewedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.166.23.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79672,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aec98b1e7be42831216a9afe86a5b0b8","RawContent":"Those turned out really great! And a great idea for keeping the wedding date on everyone&#039;s mind!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906751,"PostDate":1445621050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Those turned out really great! And a great idea for keeping the wedding date on everyone's mind!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Formatted