really love our passport invitations, specifically how closely they resemble real passports and boarding passes! I&#039;ve seen a lot of replicas but Vanessa and Daves Wedding Passports are truly the best. I am not a DIY girl by any means so they did it all from start to finish with lots of input from me on the design and details!","Attachments":[{"Id":30256,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277044-0-88956300-1418748493.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277044-0-88956300-1418748493_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563},{"Id":30257,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277044-0-95319800-1418748508.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277044-0-95319800-1418748508_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563}],"Id":1880437,"PostDate":1418748645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I really love our passport invitations, specifically how closely they resemble real passports and boarding passes! I've seen a lot of replicas but Vanessa and Daves Wedding Passports are truly the best. I am not a DIY girl by any means so they did it all from start to finish with lots of input from me on the design and details!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1432531828","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":241,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78487,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c65e70241dbf0b96d52768d3e49b7fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok. Help! Who did them for you? How was the cost - expensive or not so bad? I really want to do the boarding passes but I&#039;m not a DIYer either. I would love any info you&#039;re willing to share!!!&amp;nbsp; They turned out totally awesome!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880566,"PostDate":1418826709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok. Help! Who did them for you? How was the cost - expensive or not so bad? I really want to do the boarding passes but I'm not a DIYer either. I would love any info you're willing to share!!!\u00a0 They turned out totally awesome!!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.84.102.233","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78487,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c21a840469430c810a4a7f47902b254","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] I got them from&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/weddingpassports.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/weddingpassports.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dave and Vanessa are so great to work with and very patient!! I guess they were a little expensive but I really wanted them so I didn&#039;t mind the cost. For 60, they were $4.55 per passport and 0.75 per boarding pass. Then I got matching metallic purple envelopes from Paper and More. I LOVE them!! so worth it and it got my guests excited !&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880573,"PostDate":1418831031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I got them from\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/weddingpassports.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/weddingpassports.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Dave and Vanessa are so great to work with and very patient!! I guess they were a little expensive but I really wanted them so I didn't mind the cost. For 60, they were $4.55 per passport and 0.75 per boarding pass. Then I got matching metallic purple envelopes from Paper and More. I LOVE them!! so worth it and it got my guests excited !\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1432531828","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":241,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78487,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by TiffanyMC, 17 December 2014 - 09:24 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1418837073,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"506be0248bb73533aea6648857610849","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Very nice! Love the metallic&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880594,"PostDate":1418837062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Very nice! Love the metallic\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361737826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.162.162.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78487,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2ef16649aeccd9c6e040d2bf7c6797e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love love these&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880665,"PostDate":1418867681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love love these<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vsschick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.208.80.15","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404484310,