ebsite goes \"live\" to my guests in the next week(s) when my boarding pass invites get sent out. We are really trying to encourage booking ASAP and so the focus of our site is \"less fluff more content\"... Everyone (including grandparents) we invited uses the internet so hoping people can navigate our site and RSVP\n\n\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.kimiandmark.com\"&gt;Http:\/\/www.kimiandmark.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nAny feedback would be helpful!\n\n\nOur DIY boarding passes (for those interested) look like this: \n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1855329,"PostDate":1402839494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My website goes \"live\" to my guests in the next week(s) when my boarding pass invites get sent out. We are really trying to encourage booking ASAP and so the focus of our site is \"less fluff more content\"... Everyone (including grandparents) we invited uses the internet so hoping people can navigate our site and RSVP<br><br><br><a href='http:\/\/www.kimiandmark.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Http:\/\/www.kimiandmark.com<\/a><br><br>\nAny feedback would be helpful!<br><br>\nOur DIY boarding passes (for those interested) look like this: <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1855329]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283980131.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839801.238032.jpg - Size: 99.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283980131.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839801.238032.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1855329]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283981345.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839813.371576.jpg - Size: 104.12KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283981345.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839813.371576.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1855329]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283982149.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839821.321421.jpg - Size: 105.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283982149.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839821.321421.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1855329]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283982968.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839829.521844.jpg - Size: 108.56KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-276231-140283982968.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1402839829.521844.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by kellymiller, 15 June 2014 - 06:20 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1402842032,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed99677f94c4c1799404bb530f71c231","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Those look great! The website looks great as well, very to the point!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855331,"PostDate":1402841840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Those look great! The website looks great as well, very to the point!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.14.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b878a4f7e991608da610c1585fa7826e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your website is great!! It has everything any of your guests will need!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love your invites! They&#039;re absolutely great. Do you mind if I ask how you did them? It wasn&#039;t what I was thinking about at all, but I&#039;m sort of getting curious about them. They could definitely be neutral and wouldn&#039;t have to be for a wedding. I could do something like that as our invite I think.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855336,"PostDate":1402847264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your website is great!! It has everything any of your guests will need!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love your invites! They're absolutely great. Do you mind if I ask how you did them? It wasn't what I was thinking about at all, but I'm sort of getting curious about them. They could definitely be neutral and wouldn't have to be for a wedding. I could do something like that as our invite I think.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"575a59354173965d0fda5adf5e0a19da","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1855336\" timestamp=\"1402847264\"]\nYour website is great!! It has everything any of your guests will need!!\n\nI love your invites! They&#039;re absolutely great. Do you mind if I ask how you did them? It wasn&#039;t what I was thinking about at all, but I&#039;m sort of getting curious about them. They could definitely be neutral and wouldn&#039;t have to be for a wedding. I could do something like that as our invite I think.[\/quote]Thanks.... Hopefully our guests use the site! As for the invites, I used the free aylee bits template (google) and then customized it. You can totally change the theming etc and make it whatever you want! I added a QR code to link back to our website, and printed it on \"Curious Metalics\" paper through my personal inkjet printer, I then had to play around a bit with the pocket sleeve since I wasn&#039;t thrilled with the original layout, but once I did a few test runs I just printed them on michaels card stock and used the Martha Stewart punch to add some theming. I also added a Brad to hold the three pages of my invite together. All three printed on one piece of paper- so once I got rolling each invite cost approximately $1.05 (including the shared cost of cutting supplies) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1855339,"PostDate":1402848135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 15 June 2014 - 07:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Your website is great!! It has everything any of your guests will need!!<br><br>\nI love your invites! They're absolutely great. Do you mind if I ask how you did them? It wasn't what I was thinking about at all, but I'm sort of getting curious about them. They could definitely be neutral and wouldn't have to be for a wedding. I could do something like that as our invite I think.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks.... Hopefully our guests use the site! As for the invites, I used the free aylee bits template (google) and then customized it. You can totally change the theming etc and make it whatever you want! I added a QR code to link back to our website, and printed it on \"Curious Metalics\" paper through my personal inkjet printer, I then had to play around a bit with the pocket sleeve since I wasn't thrilled with the original layout, but once I did a few test runs I just printed them on michaels card stock and used the Martha Stewart punch to add some theming. I also added a Brad to hold the three pages of my invite together. All three printed on one piece of paper- so once I got rolling each invite cost approximately $1.05 (including the shared cost of cutting supplies) <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.14.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e51e67f890ccf226bcecd2f6bd60e3b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1855339\" timestamp=\"1402848135\"]\nThanks.... Hopefully our guests use the site! As for the invites, I used the free aylee bits template (google) and then customized it. You can totally change the theming etc and make it whatever you want! I added a QR code to link back to our website, and printed it on \"Curious Metalics\" paper through my personal inkjet printer, I then had to play around a bit with the pocket sleeve since I wasn&#039;t thrilled with the original layout, but once I did a few test runs I just printed them on michaels card stock and used the Martha Stewart punch to add some theming. I also added a Brad to hold the three pages of my invite together. All three printed on one piece of paper- so once I got rolling each invite cost approximately $1.05 (including the shared cost of cutting supplies)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\n\nWow - that sounds so hard to do!! I am the numero uno NOT diy capable person in the entire world!","Attachments":[],"Id":1855340,"PostDate":1402848710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 15 June 2014 - 08:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks.... Hopefully our guests use the site! As for the invites, I used the free aylee bits template (google) and then customized it. You can totally change the theming etc and make it whatever you want! I added a QR code to link back to our website, and printed it on \"Curious Metalics\" paper through my personal inkjet printer, I then had to play around a bit with the pocket sleeve since I wasn't thrilled with the original layout, but once I did a few test runs I just printed them on michaels card stock and used the Martha Stewart punch to add some theming. I also added a Brad to hold the three pages of my invite together. All three printed on one piece of paper- so once I got rolling each invite cost approximately $1.05 (including the shared cost of cutting supplies)<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wow - that sounds so hard to do!! I am the numero uno NOT diy capable person in the entire world!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9aee0540d3baa326b443ca7dd6381eaa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1855340\" timestamp=\"1402848710\"]\nWow - that sounds so hard to do!! I am the numero uno NOT diy capable person in the entire world![\/quote]Hahaha it really wasn&#039;t- promise! You could probably \"design\" them in an hour max... And then just print and cut! The website on the other hand... Was tedious! Not gonna lie! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1855341,"PostDate":1402848814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 15 June 2014 - 08:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Wow - that sounds so hard to do!! I am the numero uno NOT diy capable person in the entire world!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHahaha it really wasn't- promise! You could probably \"design\" them in an hour max... And then just print and cut! The website on the other hand... Was tedious! Not gonna lie! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":tr