:"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"318ef6db90acb9287f05a8287c6e4edd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1855499\" timestamp=\"1402945613\"]\nThat is so awesome!  Most airlines here don&#039;t book more than a year in advance.  I&#039;m in the US.[\/quote]Yeah it&#039;s because its a charter through a tour operator (Like Apple Vacations). Many other Canadian brides here have been told by their TA&#039;s that they cant book that far out because they arent published yet... by my TA has great relationships with the tour operator and was able to submit the request in written form and got the pricing early.","Attachments":[],"Id":1855503,"PostDate":1402945800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 16 June 2014 - 11:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>That is so awesome! \u00a0Most airlines here don't book more than a year in advance. \u00a0I'm in the US.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yeah it's because its a charter through a tour operator (Like Apple Vacations). Many other Canadian brides here have been told by their TA's that they cant book that far out because they arent published yet... by my TA has great relationships with the tour operator and was able to submit the request in written form and got the pricing early.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a3e75bf09f8fe9072229ce450ebf9d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m starting my website tonight - I&#039;m scared lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855571,"PostDate":1402968606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm starting my website tonight - I'm scared lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn_henderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402952494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tarynh86","Id":278544,"Name":"tarynh86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc3a3b35835a604a9f686cea777acd12","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tarynh86\"] don&#039;t be scurrrrd&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855929,"PostDate":1403087733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278544\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278544-tarynh86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tarynh86<\/span><\/a> don't be scurrrrd<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397440022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.187.255.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a41267e72dd9870777abbb4098b3616","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love the color and theme of your website!!! It looks great!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just started mine, hopefully i can finish in the next few days.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856028,"PostDate":1403119630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the color and theme of your website!!! It looks great!!!<\/p>\n<p>I just started mine, hopefully i can finish in the next few days.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"asmoudianis@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.187.255.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389121638,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ASmooth","Id":275923,"Name":"ASmooth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1403151532,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"392cff83baf0bc75c99d6abf07f17ad2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Website looks great and your invitations turned out so well!&amp;nbsp; You did a really good job w\/ the booking info and stressing that they MUST book w\/ your TA&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our website has been a fantastic tool for us. We&#039;ve been told a lot that the website has been really helpful in answering all questions. I&#039;m very Type A with those things as well, so I put tons of information on it so people could go to our website and travel agent for questions (not me haha)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And wow, your rate is super reasonable for Azul Sensatori! I had ruled out that hotel because I thought it&#039;d be too much. Ours is actually higher than yours!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856089,"PostDate":1403151521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Website looks great and your invitations turned out so well!\u00a0 You did a really good job w\/ the booking info and stressing that they MUST book w\/ your TA<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our website has been a fantastic tool for us. We've been told a lot that the website has been really helpful in answering all questions. I'm very Type A with those things as well, so I put tons of information on it so people could go to our website and travel agent for questions (not me haha)<\/p>\n<p>And wow, your rate is super reasonable for Azul Sensatori! I had ruled out that hotel because I thought it'd be too much. Ours is actually higher than yours!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.27.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab7c93c2612a1713ac2d82a9ad476af0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1856089\" timestamp=\"1403151521\"]\nWebsite looks great and your invitations turned out so well!  You did a really good job w\/ the booking info and stressing that they MUST book w\/ your TA\n\nOur website has been a fantastic tool for us. We&#039;ve been told a lot that the website has been really helpful in answering all questions. I&#039;m very Type A with those things as well, so I put tons of information on it so people could go to our website and travel agent for questions (not me haha)\nAnd wow, your rate is super reasonable for Azul Sensatori! I had ruled out that hotel because I thought it&#039;d be too much. Ours is actually higher than yours![\/quote]Thanks!!! Yeah our TA did an AMAZING job getting us great rates this far out! I was thrilled by the quote. I&#039;m still worried some will complain (there will always be those that are angry we chose an \"expensive resort\"... But at the end of the day, it&#039;s their choice- but are comfortable knowing if they spend the $, they will have an amazing time at a top notch resort. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1856093,"PostDate":1403158161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 18 June 2014 - 08:18 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Website looks great and your invitations turned out so well!  You did a really good job w\/ the booking info and stressing that they MUST book w\/ your TA<br><br>\nOur website has been a fantastic tool for us. We've been told a lot that the website has been really helpful in answering all questions. I'm very Type A with those things as well, so I put tons of information on it so people could go to our website and travel agent for questions (not me haha)<br>\nAnd wow, your rate is super reasonable for Azul Sensatori! I had ruled out that hotel because I thought it'd be too much. Ours is actually higher than yours!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks!!! Yeah our TA did an AMAZING job getting us great rates this far out! I was thrilled by the quote. I'm still worried some will complain (there will always be those that are angry we chose an \"expensive resort\"... But at the end of the day, it's their choice- but are comfortable knowing if they spend the $, they will have an amazing time at a top notch resort. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.20.113.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"188e83c739db3bbbc776d98170029c82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;so cute!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856147,"PostDate":1403192809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>so cute!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375975231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40f4be9c099e270ad2ff2ff5e163e1c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your website looks absolutely great. Good work done. I saw your website and the layout of your website looks good.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896742,"PostDate":1432196227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your website looks absolutely great. Good work done. I saw your website and the layout of your website looks good.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425100717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
